              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">A Warlord with this Trait gains the Preferred Enemy (Everything) special rule. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Movement phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
